# UI & styling

## Components

- Build on Radix wrappers in `src/app/components/ui/` (Dialog, Tabs, Accordion, etc.).
- Compose with `cn()` from `@/app/lib/utils`. Variants via `cva` only when the component already uses it.
- Toasts: `sonner` + existing `Toaster`. Theme: `next-themes` + `ThemeToggle`.
- Motion: `framer-motion` / `MotionBox` — always respect `useReducedMotion`.
- Images: `next/image` with real `width`/`height`, honest `sizes`, meaningful `alt`. Use `priority` only for true LCP candidates.

## Do / don't

```tsx
// ✅ semantic tokens + existing Button
<Button variant="outline">Save</Button>
<p className="text-body text-text-secondary">…</p>

// ❌ raw hex / one-off type soup / new UI kit
<div style={{ color: '#333' }} />
type MegaButtonPropsWithAllTheThings = … // unused
```

## Forms

- React Hook Form + Zod + `@hookform/resolvers` via `Form` / `FormField` components.
- Validate with Zod schemas colocated near the form — keep schemas small and used.
